{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53190","headline":"诗偈 十五 · 庞藴","name":"诗偈 十五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"如来愍诸子，平等无高下。\n诸子自愚痴，所以难教化。\n直心是道场，子心转奸诈。\n遣子净三业，转爱论俗话。\n遣子内修真，向外转寻假。\n遣子学无相，捻他有相把。\n无诤最第一，论义成相駡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"庞藴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53190.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53190","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}